\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://abyssaltheking.itch.io/minimalists/devlog\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" version=\"1.1\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li class=\"jam_entry\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/jam/secret-santa-2023/rate/2539787\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_award\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" version=\"1.1\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Secret Santa Jam 2023</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/2539787/minimalists\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" version=\"1.1\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_rubik\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Minimalists</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_2674469\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, and Linux</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Minimalists is a minimalist colony sim, with the objective to make as much money as possible, while also keeping your colonists in good shape. Your colonists have one main need, hunger, which you need to suffice.</p>\r\n<p>You start out with 2-4 colonists, and from there, you must assign them jobs, give them weapons, and make the most out of the iceberg you landed on. Raiders will attack occasionally, so you need to make sure your colonists are well prepared to attack, as the raids only get bigger as time goes on.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Music is by Context Sensitive (<a href=\"https://context-sensitive.com/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://context-sensitive.com/</a>) on the 20XX album, be sure to check him out.</p><p>All feedback is appreciated, and yes, I know the UI looks like shit, I&#x27;m aware, I&#x27;m going to look into how to make good UI sometime soon.<br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon ic